#   debug_uart_init / printascii / printch undefined.
# This NXP U-Boot vendor tree has no LPUART DEBUG_UART implementation
# (only NS16550, PL011, MXC-legacy, etc.). Would need to port the
# mainline hook into drivers/serial/serial_lpuart.c + Kconfig before
# these CONFIG_ knobs can be enabled. Left disabled until that port
# lands. See memory p1-2-spl-silent-confirmed.md for next options.
